<section><h2>Practical tech learning, wherever you are</h2><p>TCM One offers structured technology learning for people who want to move beyond passive tutorials. Learners in <?= $city ?> can join live online sessions, work through guided projects and use supplementary study resources. Session recordings and materials are available to enrolled students, as described on the course pages.</p><p>Explore learning paths in <?= $h($location['focus']) ?>. Course schedules, fees, prerequisites and included support can differ, so review the current details before enrolling.</p><div class="grid"><article class="card"><h3>Web &amp; Full Stack</h3><p>Explore frontend, backend and full stack foundations through structured courses and project work.</p></article><article class="card"><h3>Python, AI &amp; data</h3><p>Build programming, automation, AI and analytics skills with guided practice.</p></article><article class="card"><h3>Career foundations</h3><p>Strengthen problem solving and prepare a portfolio of work you can discuss.</p></article></div><a href="/courses">Browse all courses and current programme details →</a><p>Explore programme details: <a href="/courses/full-stack-web-development">Full Stack Web Development</a> · <a href="/courses/data-analytics-excel-sql-powerbi">Data Analytics</a> · <a href="/courses/dsa-problem-solving-java">DSA with Java</a> · <a href="/courses/ai-machine-learning-fundamentals">AI &amp; Machine Learning</a>.</p></section>
<section><h2>Who these programmes are for</h2><p><?= $h($location['audience']) ?> You can compare beginner-friendly options with more focused paths, check the prerequisites and choose a schedule that fits your current commitments. If you are unsure which course suits your starting point, contact the admissions team before enrolling.</p><div class="facts"><strong>What to expect</strong><ul><li>Live, instructor-led online sessions for scheduled cohorts</li><li>Guided projects and practice alongside course content</li><li>Remote access for learners in <?= $city ?> and nearby areas</li><li>Course-specific schedules, fees and support details published with each course</li></ul></div><p>TCM One is based in Waraseoni, Madhya Pradesh. These city pages describe remote programme availability and do not imply a physical classroom or branch in <?= $city ?>.</p></section>
